============================================

1. QUICK START

Metamode: touch top-left corner, then a key.
Green 'M' top-right means metamode is on.
Touch again to leave.

Default metamode keys:

  h: left     j: down
  k: up       l: right
  t: tab      e: escape
  c: control  a: alt
  v: paste    s: rescreen

Arrows stay in metamode; other keys exit.

Ctrl-C: metamode, 'c', then 'c' again.

Physical keyboard:
  - hold Space → toggle metamode
    (this is the reliable way on Classic)
  - hold letter → uppercase

Double-tap right Shift is the default for some
devices but does **not** work on Classic (Q20) —
no distinct right-Shift event. Use Space or the
top-left hitbox. Optional: set
metamode_doubletap_key to left Shift elsewhere.

On Classic, use the trackpad for arrows and
Menu for persistent Alt (section 2).

============================================

2. CLASSIC HARDWARE

TRACKPAD
  Swipe → arrow keys (DECCKM aware).
  Click → Enter ("kent") by default.

  ~/.term49rc:
    trackpad_enabled = true;
    trackpad_sensitivity = 60;
    trackpad_click_keys = "kent";

BELT KEYS
  Back → Esc (back_button_keys).
  Menu → sticky Alt mode (indicator 'a');
    same as bezel swipe-down. Hardware Alt
    is still one-shot.
  Send / End → system behaviour.

============================================

3. MOUSE / SCROLL / COPY

MOUSE (when app enables tracking:
tmux mouse, vim mouse=a, htop, ...):
  - Trackpad = pointer (inverse '+');
    click = left button
  - Touch cell = click; drag = motion
  - Alt+trackpad = wheel (app scroll)

SCROLLBACK (scrollback_lines = 500):
  - Finger drag on screen
  - Alt + trackpad swipe
  '▲' top-right while scrolled; typing
  snaps back. less/vim alt-screen ok.

COPY: Alt (or Menu Alt), drag selection;
  release → clipboard.
PASTE: metamode 'v'. Bracketed paste and
  OSC 52 *set* clipboard supported; OSC 52
  reads ignored.

CJK double-width cells + extra fonts via
font_path / fallback_font_path / cjk_font_path.

============================================

4. SHIFT+TAB

Shift held or sticky ↑:
  Tab (keyboard, metamode, sym, alt) sends
  back-tab ESC [ Z. Uppercase metamode
  bindings win when Shift is on.

============================================

5. PREFERENCES

~/.term49rc (libconfig). Created on first
run. Errors → compiled defaults.

Term49C defaults (selected):

font_path = "/usr/fonts/font_repository/dejavu/DejaVuSansMono.ttf";
fallback_font_path = "../app/native/fonts/CascadiaMonoPL-Regular.ttf";
cjk_font_path = "/usr/fonts/font_repository/monotype/MHeiM.GB18030_200910.ttf";
font_size = 20;
text_color = [255, 255, 255];
background_color = [0, 0, 0];
screen_idle_awake = false;
auto_show_vkb = true;

metamode_doubletap_key = 61666; /* right Shift; unused on Q20 */
metamode_doubletap_delay = 500000000;
keyhold_actions = true;
keyhold_actions_exempt = [KEYCODE_BACKSPACE,
                          KEYCODE_RETURN];
metamode_hold_key = 32;
tty_encoding = "UTF-8";
metamode_hitbox : { x = 0; y = 0;
                    w = 100; h = 100; };

metamode_keys : (
    ("e", "\x1B"),
    ("t", "\t")
  );
/* terminfo: kcuu1 kcud1 kcuf1 kcub1
 * khome kend kf1..kf12; hex \xHH */

metamode_sticky_keys : (
    ("k", "kcuu1"),
    ("j", "kcud1"),
    ("l", "kcuf1"),
    ("h", "kcub1")
  );

metamode_func_keys : (
    ("a", "alt_down"),
    ("c", "ctrl_down"),
    ("s", "rescreen"),
    ("v", "paste_clipboard")
  );

main_symmenu : ( (
    ("q", "\x1b"), ("w", "1"), ("e", "2"),
    ("r", "3"), ("t", "\t"), ("y", "<"),
    ("u", ">"), ("i", "\x03"), ("o", "^"),
    ("p", "%")
  ), (
    ("a", "~"), ("s", "4"), ("d", "5"),
    ("f", "6"), ("g", "\\"), ("h", "|"),
    ("j", "&"), ("k", "`"), ("l", "=")
  ), (
    ("0", "0"), ("z", "7"), ("x", "8"),
    ("c", "9"), ("v", "{"), ("b", "}"),
    ("n", "["), ("m", "]"), ("$", "\x1b[A")
  ) );

sticky_sym_key = true;
sticky_shift_key = true;
sticky_alt_key = true;
allow_resize_columns = false;
rescreen_on_symmenu = true;

trackpad_enabled = true;
trackpad_sensitivity = 60;
trackpad_click_keys = "kent";
back_button_keys = "\x1b";
scrollback_lines = 500;

prefs_version = <int>

